{"event":"The standby diesel generator serving the Brindlemoor Ice Rink shut down in the middle of a regional youth hockey tournament after a short mains interruption, leaving the arena on emergency lighting.","sources":["Odalys Frenn, rink operations manager","Teodor Marsh, arena electrician","Brindlemoor Arena Events Log","Generator controller event memory","Tournament referee Pia Lindqvist","Rink floor camera system"],"core":{"text":"The standby diesel generator at Brindlemoor Ice Rink shut down on Sunday at about 11:20 during the under-14 tournament semifinal.","source":"Brindlemoor Arena Events Log"},"facts":[{"text":"The generator controller recorded a low coolant level shutdown code at the moment the engine stopped.","source":"Generator controller event memory"},{"text":"Odalys Frenn was in the front office when the main lights dropped and the generator's start signal sounded.","source":"Odalys Frenn, rink operations manager"},{"text":"The events log notes that mains power at the arena was interrupted before the generator started.","source":"Brindlemoor Arena Events Log"},{"text":"Teodor Marsh found the generator enclosure doors closed and the engine silent when he arrived.","source":"Teodor Marsh, arena electrician"},{"text":"The controller memory shows the engine ran for 3 minutes before shutting down.","source":"Generator controller event memory"},{"text":"Pia Lindqvist stopped the semifinal and sent both teams to their benches as the lights dimmed.","source":"Tournament referee Pia Lindqvist"},{"text":"The floor camera system shows the scoreboard going dark at the same moment the rink lighting dropped to emergency level.","source":"Rink floor camera system"},{"text":"Score at the stoppage was 2 to 2 in the second period.","source":"Tournament referee Pia Lindqvist"},{"text":"The events log lists 214 spectators registered in the stands for the semifinal.","source":"Brindlemoor Arena Events Log"},{"text":"Teodor Marsh reset the controller and restarted the engine by hand.","source":"Teodor Marsh, arena electrician"},{"text":"The controller memory records a second start that ran until Marsh stopped it deliberately later in the day.","source":"Generator controller event memory"},{"text":"Frenn announced over the public address system that play would pause while the electrician checked the generator.","source":"Odalys Frenn, rink operations manager"},{"text":"The floor camera system shows the ice resurfacer parked beside the boards during the stoppage.","source":"Rink floor camera system"},{"text":"The events log records that the mains supply returned later in the afternoon.","source":"Brindlemoor Arena Events Log"},{"text":"Marsh topped up the coolant reservoir after the restart.","source":"Teodor Marsh, arena electrician"}],"disputes":[{"kind":"duration","about":"how long the arena stayed on emergency lighting before the game resumed","claims":[{"text":"The arena stayed on emergency lighting for about 12 minutes before the game resumed.","source":"Pia Lindqvist"},{"text":"The arena stayed on emergency lighting for about 25 minutes before the game resumed.","source":"Brindlemoor Arena Events Log"}]},{"kind":"decision basis","about":"why the semifinal was resumed rather than postponed","claims":[{"text":"The semifinal was resumed solely because the tournament schedule left no later slot that day.","source":"Odalys Frenn, rink operations manager"},{"text":"The semifinal was resumed solely because Marsh judged the restarted generator safe to carry the arena load.","source":"Teodor Marsh, arena electrician"}]}],"names":["Brindlemoor Ice Rink","Brindlemoor Arena Events Log"]}

