{"event":"A power-and-data failure at the Tamlyn Hythe Cold Store's automated pallet-shuttle system froze warehouse operations when its network link to the inventory server dropped on a Monday evening in November.","sources":["Shift supervisor Ioana Brask's statement","Tamlyn Hythe Cold Store Dock Gate Log","Tamlyn Hythe Shuttle Controller Event Log","Maintenance engineer Dariusz Folkestone's notes","Tamlyn Hythe Freezer Zone Temperature Record"],"core":{"text":"The automated pallet-shuttle system at the Tamlyn Hythe Cold Store stopped taking instructions from the inventory server at 7:38 p.m. on a Monday in mid-November.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Shuttle Controller Event Log"},"facts":[{"text":"The shuttle controller logged a loss of its network link to the inventory server at 7:38 p.m.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Shuttle Controller Event Log"},{"text":"Eleven shuttle carts were parked in their aisle bays when the link dropped, and the controller marked each as holding position.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Shuttle Controller Event Log"},{"text":"Shift supervisor Ioana Brask was on the loading mezzanine when the picking screens went blank.","source":"Shift supervisor Ioana Brask's statement"},{"text":"Brask told the dock crews to stop staging outbound pallets until the screens returned.","source":"Shift supervisor Ioana Brask's statement"},{"text":"Maintenance engineer Dariusz Folkestone reached the network cabinet on the first floor about ten minutes after being called.","source":"Maintenance engineer Dariusz Folkestone's notes"},{"text":"Folkestone's notes record that the cabinet's status lights on the uplink port were dark when he opened it.","source":"Maintenance engineer Dariusz Folkestone's notes"},{"text":"The dock gate log shows that 14 trucks were waiting in the yard at 8:00 p.m.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Cold Store Dock Gate Log"},{"text":"Two refrigerated trailers left the yard unloaded during the outage after their drivers ran out of permitted waiting time.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Cold Store Dock Gate Log"},{"text":"The freezer zone temperature record shows Zone B holding between minus 22 and minus 21 degrees Celsius throughout the evening.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Freezer Zone Temperature Record"},{"text":"The freezer sensors kept reporting normally, because they run on a separate monitoring circuit.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Freezer Zone Temperature Record"},{"text":"The dock doors for Zone B were opened only for manual forklift moves during the outage, according to the gate log.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Cold Store Dock Gate Log"},{"text":"Folkestone's notes say he restarted the inventory server's network interface from the console late in the evening.","source":"Maintenance engineer Dariusz Folkestone's notes"},{"text":"Brask recalls that forklift drivers moved pallets by hand using printed pick lists during the outage.","source":"Shift supervisor Ioana Brask's statement"},{"text":"The controller log records the shuttle carts resuming their queued tasks in order of priority once the link came back.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Shuttle Controller Event Log"},{"text":"The gate log notes that the first delayed truck was released from the yard after the shuttle system restarted.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Cold Store Dock Gate Log"}],"disputes":[{"kind":"time","about":"time the shuttle controller reconnected to the inventory server","claims":[{"text":"The shuttle controller reconnected to the inventory server at 9:12 p.m.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Shuttle Controller Event Log"},{"text":"The shuttle controller reconnected to the inventory server at 9:26 p.m.","source":"Maintenance engineer Dariusz Folkestone's notes"}]},{"kind":"count","about":"number of trucks that left the yard unloaded during the outage","claims":[{"text":"Three trucks left the yard unloaded during the outage.","source":"Tamlyn Hythe Cold Store Dock Gate Log"},{"text":"Five trucks left the yard unloaded during the outage.","source":"Shift supervisor Ioana Brask's statement"}]}],"names":["Tamlyn Hythe Cold Store","Shift supervisor Ioana Brask's statement","Tamlyn Hythe Cold Store Dock Gate Log","Tamlyn Hythe Shuttle Controller Event Log","Maintenance engineer Dariusz Folkestone's notes","Tamlyn Hythe Freezer Zone Temperature Record"]}

